    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thi̱ŋ nath kɛ rɔ kä I-jëp thilɛ luɔt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛmɛ ɛ nyuuth kɛ kui̱ leeyni Nɛ-gɛb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nɛy ti thil luth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱th Kuɔth kɛ Dha-yɔn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn nɛy tin cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, /cia rɔ̱ bi nyɔk kɛ wiee. Kuoth Nhial bɛ tekɛ kɔ̱a̱c lɔaac mi di̱i̱t kɛ yɛ mi wä yɛn ɛ thiec kɛ luäk. Mi wëë jɛ liŋ bɛ yɛ loc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cäŋ ni min ci Kuäär yɛ moc ciaŋ mi bɛc, /ci ram in ŋi̱i̱c yɛ rɔ bi nyɔk kɛ tëë, bi yɛn ɛ nɛn nikɛ wäŋkun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä yɛn rɔ̱ riet cuëëc kiɛ caam, bia jɔw liŋ jɔk kɛ ji̱thkun mi wee i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p, ja̱lɛ kɛ jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia kuth tin cia la̱t kɛ yiëth in bo̱r kɛnɛ kuth tin cia la̱t kɛ da̱a̱p cu yäk. Kä bia kɛ yiäk ce̱tkɛ ti jiäk, kä biakɛ jiök i̱, “Wuɔcɛ rɔ̱!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ kuay tin ci piɛth piny moc kɛ nhiaal, bi cu tekɛ bɛl ti ŋuan. Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi ɣɔ̱ɔ̱ku tekɛ wal ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi thääku kɛnɛ muɔ̱liku tin puɔ̱rkɛ mun cam ni wal ti görkɛ, bikɛ ka̱m kɛ rɛy diënyni mi̱ethdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ na̱k nath in di̱i̱t, mi wä biɛɛni wä tɛɛth, bi pääm diaal tin bär lo̱o̱ny kɛ pi̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi pay buay ce̱tnikɛ cäŋ, kä bi buay ca̱ŋ rɔ loc nikä bärɔw, bɛ ce̱tnikɛ buay ni̱ni da̱ŋ bärɔw, kɛ cäŋ in wä Kuoth Nhial buɔ̱ɔ̱t nɛɛnikɛ yiɛn kä bɛ jiööri tin cɛ ka̱m kɛ jak kä gɔaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk A-thi-ri-ya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bia diit tɛthä lɔaac kit ce̱tkɛ min la la̱tdɛ kɛ wäär kɛ cäŋ ti̱mä, kä bi lo̱ckun tɛɛth ce̱tkɛ nɛy ti jäl kɛ bul tin wä wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m Kuɔth Nhial, nɛy ti wä Pääm I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn Kuoth Nhial bɛ naath jak kä liɛŋkɛ jɔwdɛ min bum, kä bikɛ rɛmdɛ nɛn bëë piny kɛ ŋɛ̈ɛ̈ny mi di̱i̱t kɛnɛ mac mi waaŋ ŋɔak, kɛ wuɔ̱n mi ma̱a̱r kä tëë kɛ nhiaal guiiyni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi ji̱ A-thi-ri-ya dual mi wa jɔw Kuɔth Nhial liŋ, mi wëëkɛ wä duäc kɛ kɛɛtdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä Kuoth Nhial kɛ wä duäc kɛ kɛɛt tɔ̱ɔ̱ŋädɛ, bɛ kɛ duäc kɛ yikyikni kɛnɛ thuɔmni, bɛ nyieenykɛ kɛ kɛ rɛmdɛ min bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca gua̱a̱th maac rialikä nikɛ gua̱a̱th ëë ci wä. Ca rialikä kɛ kui̱ kua̱ri, ɛn pul maacdɛ ca rialikä lueŋɛ kä ɛ ɣäp ɣäp, kɛ mac mi di̱i̱t kɛ jiɛn ti ŋuan. Kä yiëë Kuɔth Nhial in ce̱tnikɛ lo̱o̱l maac, bɛ jɛ cua̱th.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
